	<p class="message"><a href="/pmn/sitemap/noticeical/1109471.ics">Add Notice to Calendar</a></p>

	<dl>

		<dt>Notice Title</dt>
		<dd>Sample Ballot for the November 3, 2026 General Election</dd>

		

		<dt>Notice Type(s)</dt>
		<dd>
			
				Notice
			
		</dd>

		<dt>Event Start Date &amp; Time</dt>
		<dd>November 3, 2026 08:00 AM</dd>

		
			<dt>Event End Date &amp; Time</dt>
			<dd>November 3, 2026 08:00 PM</dd>
		

		

		
			<dt>Description/Agenda</dt>
			<dd class="agenda">In accordance with Utah Code 20A-5-405(f)(iii): The following attachment is the Amended 2026 General Sample Ballot. </dd>
		

		
			<dt>Notice of Special Accommodations (ADA)</dt>
			<dd>NOTICE OF SPECIAL ACCOMMODATION DURING PUBLIC MEETINGS
In compliance with the Americans with Disabilities Act, individuals needing special accommodations (including auxiliary communicative aids and services) during this meeting should notify the Utah County Clerk&#039;s Office at 801-851-8683.Handicap parking is available, as well as a level entrance to the building. Interpretation services are available with prior notice for the hearing disabled.</dd>
		

		
			<dt>Notice of Electronic or Telephone Participation</dt>
			<dd>Electronic participation is available for board members.</dd>
		

		

	</dl>

</section>

<section>

	<h3>Meeting Information</h3>

	<dl>

		<dt>Meeting Location</dt>
		<dd>
			100 East Center Street
			
				<br/>Suite 3100
			
			
				<br>Provo, UT 84606
			
			<br>
